257
00:11:46,401 --> 00:11:49,258
Maghintay ka po doon.

258
00:11:49,281 --> 00:11:51,972
Sa upuang 'yon po ba?

259
00:11:51,996 --> 00:11:53,779
Oo po.

260
00:11:53,802 --> 00:11:57,387
Sa harap ng window number three.

261
00:11:57,410 --> 00:12:00,537
Gaano katagal ang paghihintay?

262
00:12:00,561 --> 00:12:03,777
Mga labinlimang minuto po.

263
00:12:03,800 --> 00:12:06,284
Naintindihan ko na.

264
00:12:06,307 --> 00:12:11,007
Tatawagin ka namin, umupo ka lang muna at maghintay.

265
00:12:11,030 --> 00:12:14,080
Opo, naiintindihan ko po.

266
00:12:14,103 --> 00:12:16,087
Salamat po.

267
00:12:16,110 --> 00:12:19,926
Ingatan mo ang iyong kalusugan.

268
00:12:19,949 --> 00:12:22,949
Tagpo 10: Paglipat sa mga Terminal ng Paliparan

269
00:12:22,949 --> 00:12:28,133
Excuse me po, saan po ang counter ng Sakura Airlines?

270
00:12:28,156 --> 00:12:30,939
Ang Sakura Airlines po ba?

271
00:12:30,962 --> 00:12:34,423
Hindi po dito.

272
00:12:34,446 --> 00:12:36,663
Ha? Totoo po ba?

273
00:12:36,686 --> 00:12:41,203
Opo, ito po ang Terminal Uno.

274
00:12:41,226 --> 00:12:44,248
Saan naman po ang Sakura Airlines?

275
00:12:44,272 --> 00:12:47,059
Sa Terminal Dos po.

276
00:12:47,083 --> 00:12:49,142
Malayo po ba?

277
00:12:49,165 --> 00:12:53,348
Opo, hindi po kayo makakapunta sa paglalakad.

278
00:12:53,371 --> 00:12:56,227
Paano po ako pupunta?

279
00:12:56,250 --> 00:12:59,033
Lumabas po kayo doon.

280
00:12:59,056 --> 00:13:01,473
Sa exit po ba?

281
00:13:01,496 --> 00:13:06,164
Opo, may darating pong dilaw na bus doon.

282
00:13:06,187 --> 00:13:08,804
Sakay po ba ako sa bus na 'yon?

283
00:13:08,827 --> 00:13:13,244
Opo, bus po 'yon papunta sa mga terminal.

284
00:13:13,267 --> 00:13:15,286
Libre po ba?

285
00:13:15,309 --> 00:13:18,292
Mga ilang minuto po ang biyahe?

286
00:13:18,315 --> 00:13:20,933
Mga limang minuto po.

287
00:13:20,956 --> 00:13:23,006
Naintindihan ko na.

288
00:13:23,029 --> 00:13:25,413
Madali po ba itong dumarating?

289
00:13:25,436 --> 00:13:29,219
Opo, may darating po bawat sampung minuto.

290
00:13:29,242 --> 00:13:31,507
Salamat sa Diyos.

291
00:13:31,531 --> 00:13:33,448
Salamat po.

292
00:13:33,471 --> 00:13:37,609
Ingat ka.